    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d304">

                <pb facs="0412" n="240" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg240"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/481</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Shea</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-14T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 14, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You are instructed discreetly to investigate and report by cable upon the
                    activities of the Government of the Argentine Republic in <pb facs="0413"
                        n="241" xml:id="pg241"/> regard to bringing about mediation by
                    Latin-American powers, now that diplomatic relations have been broken off
                    between the United States and Germany. Also report concerning the attitude of
                    the Government to which you are accredited in this connection and how reports
                    have been received in the country where you are located as to the activities of
                    the Argentine Government.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Lima and Montevideo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
